NOTE ON THE CONTENTS OF THIS REPOSITORY

This project is a methodology demonstration. Every company in its sourcing
dataset is synthetic, generated on reserved example.com domains. All operating
data is generated, not observed. The financial model is parameterised from a
written investment blueprint and is not derived from any real business.

Nothing in this repository is investment advice, a representation about any
real company, market, or transaction, or the result of diligence. It should
not be relied upon for any investment decision.

